timates are based on a sample of approximately 57,000 pharmacies\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"rates (including those for alcohol) refer to deaths involving a drug type irrespective of whether they were single or multidrug overdoses\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Changes in prescribing rates were not tested.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}